Selected sprint: SPEC FR-2.2 / instructor live leaderboard, Full-Stack MVP Sequence item 6, `US-103 Instructor Live Leaderboard Supabase Reader`, lane `normal`, non-UI provider-reader slice.

Changed:
- Added `app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/instructor-live-leaderboard-supabase-reader.ts:23` with a narrow Supabase reader for:
  - `funds`: `id,class_id,student_display_name,current_aum,sharpe_ratio`
  - `tara_orders`: `id,class_id,fund_id,month_index,status`
- Added reader tests in `app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/instructor-live-leaderboard-supabase-reader.test.ts`.
- Updated `app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/instructor-live-leaderboard-query.ts:32` and `:80` so provider reader failures return safe `{ code: 'row_reader_failed' }`.
- Added executor failure coverage in `app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/instructor-live-leaderboard-query.test.ts:193`.
- Wired `/instructor/dashboard` to prefer the Supabase live leaderboard reader when the App Router Supabase server client is available, preserving bounded fallback rows.
- Added story evidence in `docs/stories/US-103-instructor-live-leaderboard-supabase-reader.md`.
- Updated `docs/TEST_MATRIX.md`, `docs/stories/backlog.md`, and relevant product docs.

Validation:
- `npm run test:unit -- app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/instructor-live-leaderboard-query.test.ts app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/instructor-live-leaderboard-supabase-reader.test.ts` passed earlier with 2 files / 8 tests.
- `npm run typecheck` passed.
- `npm run validate:quick` passed with 50 files / 515 tests.
- `npm run smoke:routes` passed: `/` and `/login` content checks, protected `/dashboard` and `/instructor/dashboard` redirects to `/login?status=sign-in-required`.

No dependency install ran, so no audit findings. No commit, push, or PR was created.

Remaining gap reduced: the instructor live leaderboard now has a provider-backed row reader path behind the existing safe executor. Remaining item 6 gaps include hosted Supabase/browser proof plus live provider reads for instructor aggregate analytics and God Mode. Recommended next sprint: add the Supabase reader for instructor class aggregate analytics.

